## Project Overview
Building a full-featured fashion house platform with:
- Customer portal: Profile with body measurements, custom dress orders, ready-to-wear shopping
- Admin panel: Order management, progress tracking, tailor task assignment
- Authentication: Emergent Google OAuth
- Payment: Stripe integration for ready-to-wear purchases

## Key Collections Needed:
1. users - Customer profiles with role (customer/admin/tailor)
2. user_sessions - Auth sessions
3. body_measurements - Customer measurements (comprehensive + custom fields)
4. custom_orders - Custom dress orders with progress tracking
5. ready_to_wear - Ready-to-wear dress inventory
6. order_items - Shopping cart and orders for ready-to-wear
7. progress_updates - Detailed progress with photos for custom orders
8. tailors - Tailor profiles
9. task_assignments - Tasks assigned to tailors
10. payment_transactions - Stripe payment records

